WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask this, as well,
which is a cool --

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:05.105
you know, obviously, paying
homage to the original film,

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
you are -- you're playing
a character

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
who apprenticed
under Dick Van Dyke's...

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I was his intern.
-His intern.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And -- And Dick Van Dyke
was in the film.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And 91 years old.

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:17.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I -- it sounds,
from -- from what I've read,

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he is exactly the way
he's always been.

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.021 line:92%
-He's got the glint in his eye

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he has had
his entire career.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.091 line:92%
And they asked a lot of him.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
They -- He has a tap solo
on top of a desk.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:30.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I remember,
the week before,

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
we had contingency plans

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.634
of, like,
"If he can't get up on the desk,

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:35.702 line:92%
maybe you get under his leg.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:36.436 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Emily, you're spotting.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.172 size:84% position:42%
If Dick Van Dyke falls,
he's falling on either

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
Emily Blunt or Lin Miranda."
-Yeah.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.843
-Like, "We're not gonna let that
guy -- That is precious cargo.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're not letting him
touch the ground."

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we had all these plans
sort of in place.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.316 size:78% position:39%
And then, he came in,
and he was just --

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, he is --
he's human caffeine.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:53.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-He literally was like,

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
"When I was 30,
I was playing 90.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now I'm 90,
and I'm playing 80."

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:59.993 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:01.061 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like, the greatest.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then,
we rehearsed the scene,

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I, like,
offered him my hand.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:07.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
He slaps it away
and just goes, like...

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:08.968 size:75% position:38% line:92%
♪♪ Da, da, da, da ♪♪

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.837 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I mean, it was crazy!

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Laughs ]

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I...
-One deep lunge.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:19.479
-I mean, I can't even imagine
because he's 91 -- you're not,

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was terrified
when you got on my desk.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:22.348 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like, I can't --
Lin can't hurt himself here.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:29.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then I heard Meryl Streep
took a fall,

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
but a different kind of fall.
-Yes.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:35.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I asked -- listen,
working with Meryl Streep

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
is, like,
not a thing you get to do

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:37.997
on your first movie ever, ever.
-No.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:40.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But Emily -- it was her --
Emily's third movie.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I sort of asked her,
"What it's like?"

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:46.106
And she sort of, like, she's
sort of kind of in the character

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she's playing
the whole time.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she said on
"Devil Wears Prada,"

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.778
she basically barely talked
to Meryl until it was up

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:54.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they were very
contentious in that movie.

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:56.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
But in our movie,
she, like, is a delight.

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:59.719
And she's kind of always
showing off for the kids.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.521 line:92%
And she showed off for the kids.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:03.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
And at one point,
she turned to the kids --

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.258
This is between takes.
This is on the rehearsal.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:09.262
She goes, "Hey, kids,
want to see a perfect pratfall?"

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:12.232 size:81% position:41%
And she goes from here
to facedown, like --

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:17.370
like Chevy Chase 1975 pratfall.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:18.671 line:92%
And, like, just on her face.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.706 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And everyone runs over.

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:21.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Meryl Streep
has died on our set!"

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:22.475 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she gets up.
And she goes like this.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I learned that
at Yale School of Drama."

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Wow!

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:30.817
-And it was just the coolest --
coolest thing ever.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]
-They -- They say --

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:35.855
They say of all the Ivies,
Yale is the pratfall school.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:36.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's the pratfall school.
-Yeah.

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:37.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-This is really exciting.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:41.528
You are gonna get back onstage
to do "Hamilton" in Puerto Rico.

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:42.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right.
-In January.

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:44.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. I have
my first rehearsal tomorrow.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:47.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, no, you didn't
get a break at all.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-When you say --

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.638
I mean, first rehearsal,
how -- do you -- do you --

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:53.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, it will
come back quickly, yes?

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:54.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think so.
-Yeah.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.875
-I mean, our --
So, our incredible new company,

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is -- this is
the third national tour

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
that will premiere
in Puerto Rico.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:01.014
We'll raise as much money
as we can for Puerto Rico,

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:03.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then it goes on
to tour the United States.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:04.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
They've been rehearsing
for five weeks.

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have been talking about
"Mary Poppins."

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.820 line:92%
-[ Laughing ] Right, yeah.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so I'll join them
and sort of stumble through --

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.658 line:92%
emphasis on the "stumble"...

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:12.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-...tomorrow.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.394 size:81% position:41%
And it's all in there.
It's sort of like --

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think it's --
You know, I think of my brain

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
