with too many apps open.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just have to
clean up the files.

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:21.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
I never hit "Empty trash"
at any point.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
They're all there.

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good.
-I just have to remember.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And the --
This is very exciting.

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jimmy Fallon is taking
"The Tonight Show"

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
