-I think that's really cool.

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:35.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's great
that you're raising money.

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yeah.

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:38.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And just in general,
